{"id": "z0380", "pool": "know-longtail", "n_q_chunks": 2, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The producer of the tomb was a man named Howard Carter. He worked with a wealthy Englishman called Lord Carnar von to explore and uncover ancient Egypt ian sites. Together, they discovered the famous burial chamber in 1922, which held treasure s from King T utankhamun's time. So, while Carter led the actual excavation, he was supported by Ca rnavon who helped fund the project.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 23, "carrier_ended": null}
