{"id": "z0484", "pool": "know-longtail", "n_q_chunks": 2, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Agbala Shidari is a genre of music from Nigeria. It's often described as a blend of traditional Nigerian sounds with elements of high life, afro-hip hop, and contemporary pop. The term \"Agbala\" roughly translate s to \"big city,\" so the music usually reflects urban themes, lifestyle s, and modern experiences. It' s known for its catchy rhythm s and relatable lyrics that speak to everyday life in the city.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 23, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "z0492", "pool": "know-longtail", "n_q_chunks": 2, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The director of Sukho ban was Mr. T oshiaki Sato.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 4, "carrier_ended": null}
