{"id": "z0924", "pool": "know-commonsense", "n_q_chunks": 8, "onset_chunk": 7, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Aside from water and nourishment, your dog needs lots of attention. Dogs are social animals that thrive on interaction with their humans. They need love, play time, and consistent care to stay happy and healthy. While bones can be tempting, they aren't always safe, and walks are important too, but attention is key for their emotional well-being.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 17, "carrier_ended": null}
