{"id": "z1116", "pool": "know-openbook", "n_q_chunks": 7, "onset_chunk": 6, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "When a city tear s down a park, the most accurate choice is A, removed. Tear ing down means physically taking it away, so removing it makes sense. The other options like renewing or restoring usually apply to improvements, not destruction.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 14, "carrier_ended": null}
